export anchor FaxStyle:
    number: 168
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Fax
    idea: The dashboard arrives as a faxed cover sheet, with a transmission line across the top, a boxed To and From form, heavy black toner on slightly grainy paper, halftone bars and rubber-stamped statuses.
    base: light
    palette:
        tray: #e3e1da, the page behind the sheet
        thermalSheet: #f5f4ef, the paper, under a 14 percent noise grain
        toner: #141414, all text, rules, stamps and buttons
        greyToner: #4a4a46, departments and placeholders
        scanStreak: #d8d6cf, faint vertical streaks, never text
        halftone: #8a8a85, how dotted fills read at a distance
        focus: #1748b0, the focus outline and the only colour
    type:
        Three stacks. Headings and the FAX mark use Arial Black, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial at 900. Body and form values use Helvetica Neue,
        Helvetica, Arial, Liberation Sans. The header line and log columns
        use Lucida Console, Courier New, Liberation Mono. The FAX mark is
        64px, the title 30px caps, total figures 52px heavy, form values
        16px bold, body 15px, form keys 12px bold caps tracked 0.08em and
        the header line 12px mono. Text has a 0.7px blur bleed.
    layout:
        One sheet tilted 0.35 degrees with grain and two faint vertical
        scan streaks. A mono transmission line runs across the top with
        the date and time, FROM BRIGHTWORK, TO MARA OKAFOR and P.01 of 01.
        The cover has a reversed black FAX block, the title Brightwork
        cover sheet and the signed-in name, over a 6px black bar. A boxed
        form follows with To, From, Date and Pages in two columns, Re
        holding the greeting and the overdue line, Route holding the nav
        as checkboxes with Home crossed, and Look up holding the search,
        New project and Notices. Then four boxed totals with the overdue
        box double framed, a black-headed project table with halftone
        progress bars and stamped statuses, and two columns with a framed
        bar chart, dotted last week and solid this week, beside an activity
        report table with number, time, activity and an OK result column.
        A mono footer closes the sheet. Below 860px the tilt is removed,
        the form becomes one column and the table scrolls sideways.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 10px cell padding, 12px between boxes, 28px above section heads.
    density: Medium-dense office form, with boxed fields and tables edge to edge.
    corners: Square everywhere. Only the On track stamp is a full pill.
    borders: 2px toner boxes, a 6px bar under the cover, a 6px double frame on the overdue figure, dotted log rules.
    shadows: One soft shadow under the sheet. Text bleeds with a 0.7px blur.
    icons:
        Rubber stamps tilted 2 degrees. A pill stamp with a ringed check
        for On track, a dashed stamp with a triangle for At risk, a solid
        black stamp with a crossed box for Behind, and a filled circle with
        a bang for Overdue.
    focus: A 3px focus blue outline offset 2px.
    tone: Office paperwork, such as Re, Route, Look up, Activity report and P.01 of 01.
